{"kind":"assert","text":"Order of work to a stable base (10 November 2026). This act replaces\nthe phase 3 order that followed the identifiers heads.\n\nHugh decided on 10 November to wind development down to a base that\nstays stable, runs deployed, and supports users and applications.\nThe rule for order: a change that retires rooms or changes a\ndefinition identity lands before the base opens to users. A change\nthat only adds can follow.\n\n1. Typed heads F, G and H finish as the lanes act 88cf23c3 says.\n2. Identifiers heads (b) a30f1b67 and then (c+d), under 05d618e2.\n   The planner then recreates the Grow, Lending and J5 Site rooms\n   and reruns J5 acceptance. Head (e), the sequence HTTP binding,\n   leaves the plan. It adds only, and it can follow the base.\n3. The Sequenced level, first version, after (c+d). Request\n   333de97b stays the parent. Do not start it yet. The planner first\n   amends the Sequenced note: references in the new shape, one\n   answer on who creates the order scope, reads at a cut against\n   the journal floor, kernel promise 5, and the K item that the\n   filing rule of docs/kernel.md 7.1 needs. The planner then files\n   the slices.\n4. The Live level, after a planner design note that settles its\n   seven open decisions against current code.\n5. In parallel lanes, as each is filed: ordinary package install in\n   a new room, a checked-in deploy script and runbook, the archive\n   binding for every room with one restore drill, and the published\n   CLI. The planner audits their state and files each request.\n6. Hosted Claude and ChatGPT acceptance (O4) runs when the browser\n   join is available.\n\nThese leave the queue. Do not start them: sales C1 7a7d976c, market\nM1a a9fcb813, foreign-hold 416238f2, DX-B1, DX-C1, DX-C2, hosted\nagent teams (RI1 cad348ea, ecc3ff15 and later slices), Goose remote\nand Gemini. Join parity 9719b634 waits for a planner ruling on\nwhether the base needs it.\n\nNo lane changes today. F, G, H and identifiers (b) are all in items\n1 and 2. The documentation request 044311b0 is planner work and\ntakes no builder slot.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}